              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you’re building a fleet, choosing the right trucks is one of the most important decisions you’ll make. At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we believe International Trucks offer the ideal combination of durability, innovation, and long-term value for businesses across Florida and beyond. Whether you’re launching a new operation or expanding an existing one, here are five compelling reasons why International Trucks should be at the heart of your fleet strategy.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
