                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "h-performance",
                          "type": "heading",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Built for Performance and Longevity",
                            "headingLevel": 2,
                            "align": "left",
                            "anchor": "performance"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-performance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "International Trucks are engineered to handle the toughest jobs across industries—from long-haul freight to construction, waste management, and final-mile delivery. Models like the LT® Series are designed with both power and efficiency in mind, offering advanced aerodynamics and a bold, durable interior that stands up to daily wear and tear. The HX® Series, built for heavy-duty applications, features a rugged structure and enhanced comfort, ensuring drivers can perform at their best even in demanding conditions.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-performance-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With International Trucks, you’re investing in vehicles that are built to last, reducing the need for frequent replacements and keeping your fleet on the road longer. This kind of longevity means fewer disruptions, improved ROI, and a stronger foundation for your growing business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
