                            "text": "Advanced Technology for Smarter Operations",
                            "headingLevel": 2,
                            "align": "left",
                            "anchor": "technology"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-technology-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "International Trucks are equipped with cutting-edge technology designed to enhance safety, efficiency, and fleet management. The Diamond Logic® electrical system offers advanced diagnostics and customizable features, allowing for better control and monitoring of vehicle functions. This technology not only supports safe operations but also enables proactive maintenance, helping to reduce unexpected repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-technology-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Additionally, the <a href=\"/service-appointment\">International® 360</a> platform provides real-time data and insights, enabling fleet managers to make informed decisions and address maintenance needs before they become bigger problems. With tools like remote diagnostics and predictive maintenance tracking, you can minimize downtime and keep your trucks running smoothly.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
