                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-support-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you choose International Trucks, you’re not just getting a vehicle—you’re gaining access to a vast support network. With dealer locations all across North America, including <a href=\"/\">Sun State International’s</a> full-service facilities in <a href=\"/locations/tampa\">Tampa</a>, <a href=\"/locations/sarasota\">Sarasota</a>, and <a href=\"/locations/davenport\">Davenport</a>, you can count on expert service wherever your routes take you.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-support-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our certified technicians are trained to handle everything from routine maintenance to complex repairs. With programs like Fleet Charge® Advantage, you benefit from guaranteed parts pricing, consolidated billing, and instant credit recognition, simplifying the management of your fleet’s service needs. No matter where your trucks are or what they need, support is never far away.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
