                {
                  "id": "p-financing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we understand that every business has unique financial needs. That’s why we offer a range of flexible financing and leasing options tailored to your specific requirements. Whether you’re looking to purchase new trucks, lease vehicles, or explore rental solutions, our experienced finance team is here to help you find the best fit for your budget. Our goal is to make it as easy as possible for you to build a fleet that delivers long-term value, without straining your financial resources.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
