                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to Build Your Fleet with International Trucks?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ready"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you’re starting from scratch or expanding your existing operations, International Trucks offers the performance, technology, and support you need to succeed. At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we’re proud to help Florida businesses take their fleets to the next level. <a href=\"/contact\">Contact us today to learn more about our current inventory, financing options, and how we can help you build a fleet that drives your business forward!</a>",
